Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add devil's advocate: source-backed thesis stress test
 before trades

New challenge_thesis voice tool asks up to 3 pointed questions per thesis,
grounded in SEC filing / press release excerpts for BTC, ETH and SOL.
Open-model questions are citation-checked server-side with pre-written
fallbacks. Adds /api/devil endpoints, DevilCard UI, agent prompt and tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AwbeTGm1cjjZ8KLHFf1J48
